From: William Emerison Six <billsix@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 7 Sep 2026 23:53:58 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2858/3799] soh: rename D_80ADD700 -> sEnvColors

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: the four sisters' env colours
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Po_Sisters/z_en_po_sisters.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Po_Sisters/z_en_po_sisters.c | 5 +++--
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Po_Sisters/z_en_po_sisters.c b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Po_Sisters/z_en_po_sisters.c
index 0bfdd66d3..5dc18798c 100644
--- a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Po_Sisters/z_en_po_sisters.c
+++ b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Po_Sisters/z_en_po_sisters.c
@@ -89,7 +89,8 @@ static Color_RGBA8 sPrimColors[4] = {  // was D_80ADD6F0 [LLM:HIGH]
     { 170, 255, 0, 255 },
 };
 
-static Color_RGBA8 D_80ADD700[4] = {
+// LLM generated name (HIGH), was D_80ADD700: the four sisters' env colours
+static Color_RGBA8 sEnvColors[4] = {  // was D_80ADD700 [LLM:HIGH]
     { 100, 0, 255, 255 },
     { 255, 0, 0, 255 },
     { 0, 0, 255, 255 },
@@ -1406,7 +1407,7 @@ void EnPoSisters_Draw(Actor* thisx, PlayState* play) {
     f32 phi_f20;
     s32 i;
     u8 spE7 = 0;
-    Color_RGBA8* temp_s1 = &D_80ADD700[this->unk_194];
+    Color_RGBA8* temp_s1 = &sEnvColors[this->unk_194];  // was D_80ADD700 [LLM:HIGH]
     Color_RGBA8* temp_s7 = &sPrimColors[this->unk_194];  // was D_80ADD6F0 [LLM:HIGH]
     s32 pad;
 
